{"state":"okay","message":"정상적으로 데이터를 가져왔습니다.","payload":[{"WordDictionary":"<div class=\"top_txt\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; clear: both; overflow: hidden; height: 20px; vertical-align: top; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 20px !important; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><p class=\"s_tit\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(1, 1, 1); font-weight: bold; float: left; font-size: 14px !important; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">운영체제</p></div><p class=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px !important;\">OS</span>&nbsp;(<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px !important;\">O</span>perating&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px !important;\">S</span>ystem)</p><p class=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\"><br style=\"line-height: 20px !important;\"></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\">개인용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 나눔고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 20px !important;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\">가정용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 나눔고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 20px !important;\">, 사업장</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\">용 노트북/PC의 운영체제는 대부분 마이크로소프트사의 운영체제를 사용하고 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 나눔고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 20px !important;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\">운영체제의 발표 시기에 따라 윈도우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 나눔고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 20px !important;\">XP&nbsp;→&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\">윈도우 비스타&nbsp;→</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 나눔고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 20px !important;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\">윈도우&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 나눔고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 20px !important;\">7→ 윈도우 8→윈도우10</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\">의 순으로 현재 판매되는 대부분의 운영체제 포함된 모델은 윈도우10을 기본 설치되고 있습니다.(맥북 시리즈는 예외)</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 나눔고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 20px !important;\"></span>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><img border=\"0\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://img.danawa.com/images/termDicImages/1/1/313_1_1543561059.JPG\" width=\"354\" height=\"471\" style=\"border: 0px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 20px !important; height: auto !important;\"></p></div><p class=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">노트북의 경우&nbsp;대부분 설치된&nbsp;기기에서만 재설치 가능한 DSP버전이 설치되어 판매되며 이전 설치까지 필요로 한다면 별도의 처음사용자용 버전으로 구입하셔야 됩니다.</p><p class=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 20px !important;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\">참고로 프로그래머</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 나눔고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; line-height: 20px !important;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\">서버 관리자들은 리눅스 운영체제를 선택하기도